cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to Research Studio, please cite it as below."
title: "Research Studio: a workspace for proofreading research papers together"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Khan"
    given-names: "Abdullah Aman"
repository-code: "https://github.com/abdkhanstd/ResearchStudio"
url: "https://studio.rykhet.com"
license-url: "https://github.com/abdkhanstd/ResearchStudio/blob/main/LICENSE"
date-released: "2026-11-18"
version: "1.0.0"
keywords:
  - manuscript proofreading
  - collaborative proofreading
  - research integrity
  - LaTeX
abstract: >-
  Research Studio is a workspace for the final read of a research manuscript by its co-authors:
  paragraph-by-paragraph proofreading with reading checks, verification of the manuscript's numbers against its
  own tables and figures, figures read back into data, history with undo, and LaTeX write-back with change markup.
  Source available for personal, non-commercial use only.
